  m_text: 'Todo List

    - Add indicators to what elements are in the flask

    -
    Sounds to indicate things were grabbed and interacted with

    - An exit indicator
    next to this door so people don''t think their game " on ", crashed

    - Make
    the objective more clear

    - Add a menu before this area as a title screen,
    or implement it on this wall to activate all controlls

    - Settings... yeah...
    2 weeks that''s been put off

    - Actually visually design this room, the greybox
    is bad

    - A way to move the held item up and down for visual clarity

    -
    Cry in the corner


    If anyone reads to the end of this, lmk what else should
    be added to the immediate list.

    And stop adding more than 2 ingredients
    together, it''s written on the book of instructions'
